{'symbol': 'DIS', 'date': '2022-10-31 09:00:00', 'title': 'SINCLAIR BROADCAST GROUP, INC. AND DISNEY MEDIA & ENTERTAINMENT DISTRIBUTION ANNOUNCE RENEWALS OF ABC AFFILIATION AGREEMENTS INTO 2026', 'text': 'BALTIMORE & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--SINCLAIR BROADCAST GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: SBGI) AND DISNEY MEDIA & ENTERTAINMENT DISTRIBUTION (NYSE: DIS) TODAY ANNOUNCED A MULTI-YEAR DEAL THAT RENEWS ABC AFFILIATIONS ACROSS ALL SINCLAIR STATIONS INTO 2026.'}